        "algorithm": "7-Day Smoothing (Today 15% + History 85%)",
        "desc": "Daily scale weight fluctuates by 1~2kg due to water retention, sodium, and digestion. By blending 85% historical baseline with 15% daily weight over a 7-day window, it filters out transient noise to objectively track true changes in fat and muscle tissue."
